1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:07,710
Same command, same pixels.

2
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:21,930
30324 B on 6.1.1, 26482 B on 8.1.2.

3
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:33,690
Four questions about one PNG command.

4
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:43,490
Ubuntu 6.1.1 and Windows 8.1.2.

5
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:53,040
Reader 1: size and decoded pixels.

6
00:00:53,040 --> 00:01:04,180
Reader 2: our parser reads every row.

7
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:17,800
Filter byte 0 to 4, one per row.

8
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:26,320
Smooth rows leave small differences.

9
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:34,510
6.1.1: -pred default none.

10
00:01:34,510 --> 00:01:42,710
8.1.2: -pred default paeth.

11
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:50,990
6.1.1: 360 rows, all filter 0.

12
00:01:50,990 --> 00:02:02,020
8.1.2: filter 1, then 359 of filter 4.

13
00:02:02,020 --> 00:02:12,710
112 files, one set of pixels.

14
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:18,050
Both readers agree.

15
00:02:18,050 --> 00:02:28,230
135338 B to 2229 B.

16
00:02:28,230 --> 00:02:34,340
98.4 % smaller.

17
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:41,910
Noisy field: 38.8 % smaller.

18
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:52,500
Test pattern 12.7 %, mandelbrot 9.9 %.

19
00:02:52,500 --> 00:03:02,900
Flat runs: 51.4 % bigger.

20
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:13,300
Four-color noise: 78.4 % bigger.

21
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:21,570
White noise: 173623 B, every mode.

22
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:25,700
Nothing to predict.

23
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:36,650
-pred mixed: a filter per row.

24
00:03:36,650 --> 00:03:49,420
Flat runs: 4461 B, not 6581 B.

25
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:58,590
Level 9 is not always smaller.

26
00:03:58,590 --> 00:04:13,870
Noisy field: 101688 B at 6, 109444 B at 9.

27
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:25,320
rgba: 225431 B to 123991 B.

28
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:38,670
16-bit rgb: 260074 B to 124616 B.

29
00:04:38,670 --> 00:04:53,050
Filters match: 96 of 96.

30
00:04:53,050 --> 00:05:07,420
Bytes match: 0 of 96.

31
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:15,940
Pin -pred, or hash the pixels.

32
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:25,870
Try mixed. For flat art, try none.

33
00:05:25,870 --> 00:05:33,720
Default: none to paeth.

34
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:41,560
Pixels same, bytes different.

35
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:50,130
Not tested: real photos, other builds.

36
00:05:50,130 --> 00:05:57,280
Synthetic images. 6.1.1 and 8.1.2.
